; Local allow list: names here are answered normally even when the Cat-egory list blocks them.
; It is listed before the Cat-egory zone in every server's config; the first zone that matches wins.
$TTL 300
$ORIGIN allow.local.
@ SOA localhost. hostmaster.localhost. (1 3600 600 86400 300)
@ NS localhost.
example.net CNAME rpz-passthru.
*.example.net CNAME rpz-passthru.
